          "type": "player_name",
          "example": "inkkni"
        }
      ],
      "gloss": "Heart of the Forest 沿用 Hub_General/GUI_Item/Your_Skills.json#skills_heart_of_the_forest 与 _shared/Terms.json 的森林之心；此处是解锁引导，不是要求交付心脏物品。Hina 是 NPC 人名，保留英文。",
